msgid "ErreD EU Order Withdrawal for WooCommerce"
msgstr "ErreD EU Order Withdrawal for WooCommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: recesso-digitale.php
msgid ""
"Digital withdrawal function for WooCommerce: the EU \"easy withdrawal\" duty "
"(Directive 2023/2673, in force 19 June 2026) and its Italian transposition "
"(art. 54-bis Codice del Consumo). HPOS-native, security-first."
msgstr ""
"Funzione di recesso digitale per WooCommerce: l'obbligo UE di \"recesso "
"facile\" (Direttiva 2023/2673, in vigore dal 19 giugno 2026) e la sua "
"trasposizione italiana (art. 54-bis del Codice del Consumo). Nativo HPOS, "
"sicurezza al primo posto."

#. Author of the plugin
#: recesso-digitale.php
msgid "ErreD"
msgstr "ErreD"

#: recesso-digitale.php:36
msgid ""
"ErreD EU Order Withdrawal for WooCommerce requires PHP 8.2 or newer and has "
"been deactivated."
msgstr ""
"ErreD EU Order Withdrawal for WooCommerce richiede PHP 8.2 o successivo ed è "
"stato disattivato."

#: recesso-digitale.php:52
msgid ""
"ErreD EU Order Withdrawal for WooCommerce is missing its autoloader. Run "
"\"composer install\" or reinstall the plugin."
msgstr ""
"ErreD EU Order Withdrawal for WooCommerce non trova il suo autoloader. "
"Esegui \"composer install\" o reinstalla il plugin."

